        <mxCell id="note1" value="Auth Flow:&lt;br&gt;1. User hits /login → redirect to Okta&lt;br&gt;2. Okta authenticates → OIDC callback&lt;br&gt;3. OktaOIDCMiddleware validates token&lt;br&gt;4. RoleGuard extracts role from claims&lt;br&gt;5. admin role → Admin Console routes&lt;br&gt;6. user role → Dashboard routes only&lt;br&gt;7. Unauthorized → 403 page" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
